  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatchling Shadow Marked from birth, \"Matchstick\" was born into a Subchain City flock known as the Cinderquacks, a crew who specialized in burning down abandoned infrastructure for warmth and DRIP salvage. Surviving a raid gone wrong saw him orphaned and forced to adapt, scavenging scraps and learning to fight dirty in the ruins before finding his own place amongst the Sk8rs.",
    "class": "Pyromaniac Scavenger",
    "name": "Matchstick",
    "personality": "Reckless and impulsive, Matchstick is always itching for a fight or a chance to set something ablaze. He's fiercely independent but secretly craves the camaraderie of a flock, constantly pushing boundaries to test loyalty. Beneath the pyrotechnics lies a surprisingly quick wit and a talent for improvising under pressure and a desperate need for family.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Matchstick hurls a Molotov cocktail cobbled together from salvaged DRIP reserves that sets a target area ablaze. Enemies caught in the flames suffer damage over time, and the burning area provides a visual obscurance.",
